metadata.installation:
First, install the Playwright MCP server with your client.
**Standard config** works in most of the tools:
```js
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "playwright": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "@playwright/mcp@latest"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
